verify 1
unmap 0 65536
unmap 1 65536
retire 1
prepare 1 18 64 7
snapshot 19 4096
fill 32
seal
snapshot-verify
verify 0
verify 2
audit
discard
retire 2
prepare 2 20 64 7
region 2 4194304 1 5
